menu "UART_ECHO_Polling testcase"

config UART_ECHO_RX_TIMEOUT_POLLS
    int "Echo RX timeout (poll iterations, not milliseconds)"
    range 1 100000000
    default 10000
    help
        Budget poll cho mot lan Receive mot byte trong testcase.
        Timeout khi chua co du lieu duoc dem va tiep tuc nhan.

config UART_ECHO_TX_TIMEOUT_POLLS
    int "Echo TX timeout (poll iterations, not milliseconds)"
    range 1 100000000
    default 1000000
    help
        Budget poll cho mot lan Transmit mot byte echo.
        Khi loi, testcase ghi nhan va tiep tuc nhan, khong tu gui lai byte.
        Baud va clock dung chung cau hinh cua FPGA_Terminal.

endmenu
